---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Us | Finance with Flow"
  description="Discover the story behind Finance with Flow, our mission to empower SMEs, and our founder Roz Johnson's 20+ years of corporate finance leadership."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-[#FEF9F3] py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center max-w-3xl">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#3456A7] bg-[#3456A7]/10 mb-4">
        Our Story & Mission
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#160F3F] tracking-tight mb-4">
        Who We Are
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
        Empowering businesses to thrive through dedicated outsourced finance leadership and meticulous accounting.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Story Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose max-w-none text-slate-700 text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#160F3F]">Where It All Began</h2>
        
        <p>
          Our journey began with <strong>Roz Johnson</strong>. With over 20 years of experience at the helm of large corporate finance teams, Roz's passion for business finance grew after following in her father's footsteps into the family business. That led to a formal training contract with a Top 10 accountancy practice, where she qualified as an ACA chartered accountant.
        </p>

        <p>
          Four rigorous years in audit gave Roz a solid grounding across a vast range of industries and business scales. Key clients during this formative period included a <strong>£500m revenue construction group</strong>, listed public entities, and dynamic family-run enterprises. Over the subsequent two decades, her career spanned £1bn global entities, private-equity backed start-ups, and complex turnaround situations.
        </p>

        <div class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-slate-100">
          <img 
            src="/images/branding/collaboration.png" 
            alt="Finance with Flow team collaboration" 
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
          />
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#160F3F]">The Realisation: Levelling The Playing Field For SMEs</h2>

        <p>
          Throughout her career in corporate finance, Roz observed a persistent divide: large multinational enterprises possessed teams of specialised bookkeepers, credit controllers, systems accountants, and seasoned finance directors. Meanwhile, ambitious small and medium enterprises (SMEs) were frequently stuck between basic annual compliance accountants and the prohibitive overhead of hiring full-time in-house departments.
        </p>

        <p>
          This path ultimately led Roz to the realization that her knowledge, leadership, and expertise could have a profound, transformative impact on SMEs. By creating <strong>Finance with Flow</strong>, she established a ready-made, modular outsourced finance department: giving growing businesses the functionality, insight, and strategic direction of an enterprise-grade finance team at an accessible, flexible cost.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#160F3F]">Our Core Values</h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 not-prose my-8">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#160F3F] mb-2">Clarity Over Complexity</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We decode the financial jargon. We communicate numbers with total transparency, giving you insights you can immediately act upon.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#160F3F] mb-2">Proactive Partnership</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We don't wait for year-end to talk to you. We work alongside you weekly and monthly, spotting challenges and opportunities well in advance.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#160F3F] mb-2">Specialist Sector Depth</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">From construction CIS and retentions to project-costed services, we understand the real-world operational rhythms of your industry.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#160F3F] mb-2">Modern Technology</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">As certified Xero partners, we leverage cloud automations and modern dashboards to eliminate paperwork and eliminate manual errors.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 text-center border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
        <a 
          href="/meet-the-team" 
          class="inline-block px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-base font-bold text-white bg-[#3456A7] hover:bg-[#160F3F] transition-all shadow-md"
        >
          Meet The Professionals Behind Flow →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
